<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70727" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηπύ̆τι-ος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Ep.
		
		
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήπιος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>little child,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηκέτι ταῦτα λεγώμεθα νηπύτιοι ὥς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.292
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηπύτιον ὥς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.200
				</span></i>
			; once in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. γάρ ἐστ᾽ ἔτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Nu.</u>
					868
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			Adj., <i>childish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέεσσί γε νηπυτίοισιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.211
				</span></i>
			; <i>foolish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[βροτοί]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>L.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
